{"id":"yakoby","lemma":"якобы","pos":"adv","rank":2677,"glosses":["allegedly, supposedly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/90/Ru-%D1%8F%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8B.ogg/Ru-%D1%8F%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8B.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она его якобы убила.","en":"She allegedly killed him.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"to kill","l":"убить"}]},{"text":"Я слышал, якобы он умер.","en":"I heard that he'd died.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"}]},{"text":"Том якобы был в зоопарке.","en":"Tom was supposedly at the zoo.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Он пришёл ко мне домой, якобы чтобы увидеть меня.","en":"He came to my house on the pretext of seeing me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"home"},null,{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Они якобы достигли соглашения.","en":"They supposedly have reached a deal.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"to reach, to arrive at","l":"достичь"},{"g":"agreement","l":"соглашение"}]}]}